{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2022-01-10 17:42:00', 'title': 'RIO TINTO ORDERS WABTEC FLXDRIVE BATTERY LOCOMOTIVES TO REDUCE EMISSIONS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) AND RIO TINTO ANNOUNCED TODAY AN ORDER FOR FOUR FLXDRIVE BATTERY-ELECTRIC LOCOMOTIVES TO SUPPORT SUSTAINABLE OPERATIONS OF THE MINING COMPANY'S RAIL NETWORK IN THE PILBARA REGION OF WESTERN AUSTRALIA. THE 100-PERCENT, BATTERY-POWERED LOCOMOTIVE WILL HELP RIO TINTO'S EFFORT TO ACHIEVE A 50-PERCENT REDUCTION IN SCOPE 1 AND 2 CARBON EMISSIONS BY 2030. “OUR PARTNERSHIP WITH WABTEC IS AN INVESTMENT IN INNOVATION AND AN ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF THE"}